        "Description": "Donna Paris, widow of Dawood Rangan, has recnetly inherited his vast fortune after his &quot;unfortunate&quot; accident. Using these funds, She has bribed manager of an event in Dubai, Cindy Burns and Head Security, Husain Akel. Together, they plan to extort Sheikh Omar-Al-Ghazali for his entire networth, lock down the building, and eliminate every celebrity and investor there to complete a contract worth 6 Billion. Our client cannot have this, and it is up to you to stop this, 47. Good luck.\r\rShkerrrr-",
